# ==============================================================================
# FILE HEADER: Git Ignore Rules — Antigravity Enterprise Gateway
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose:
#   Prevents credentials, local environment overrides, generated client configs,
#   language build/dependency artifacts, and OS/IDE noise from being committed.
#
# Architecture / Context:
#   Applies across the unified `enterprise-gateway/` directory covering both
#   Go (`go/`) and Python (`python/`) runtimes as well as `model-armor-sdp/`.
#   Note: `settings.env` and `.env.example` contain non-sensitive defaults and
#   templates and are intentionally tracked in version control.
#
# Dependencies / Side Effects:
#   Enforced automatically by Git on `git status`, `git add`, and `git commit`.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BLOCK 1: Secrets, Credentials & Local Environment Overrides
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
admin_settings.local.json
*.local.json
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cer
*.der
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
*secret*.json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BLOCK 2: Go Build & Test Artifacts
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
go/gateway
go/antigravity-gateway
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
coverage.txt

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BLOCK 3: Python Virtual Environments & Bytecode Caches
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
venv/
.venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BLOCK 4: OS & Editor / IDE Noise
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
